{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02512","headline":"游隋故都 · 陆敬","name":"游隋故都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛城聊顾步，长想遂留连。\n水鬬宫初毁，风变鼎将迁。\n皐陶德不建，汾隅祀忽焉。\n宗祊旷无象，声朔缅谁传。\n枌榆何冷落，禾黍郁芊緜。\n悲歌尽商颂，太息悯周篇。\n来苏伫圣德，濡足乃乘乾。\n正始淳风被，人劳用息肩。\n舞象文思泽，偃伯武功宣。\n则百昌厥後，於万永斯年。\n兹辰素商节，灰管变星躔。\n平原悴秋草，乔木敛寒烟。\n翻黄坠疎叶，凝翠积高天。\n参差海曲鴈，寂寞柳门蝉。\n兴悼今如此，悲愁复在旃。\n彷徨不忍去，杖策屡回邅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆敬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}